  m_text: "Step into the shoes of a healthcare professional during a challenging
    day on the ward.\n\nEvery decision you make affects your patients \u2014 and
    your own understanding of what it means to provide care under pressure.\n\nUse
    your clinical reasoning skills to assess, prioritize, and act.\n\nEnd your shift
    with confidence\u2026 if you can."
